  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "In a realm of feudal Japanese folklore the eponymous Ninja Jajamaru-kun must rescue his beloved Princess Sakura from the clutches of a fiendish catfish-faced pirate. \n\nJajamaru-kun begins on the bottom of a three tiered horizontal field. On each level of this field there are two enemies on each tier. The tiers have weak brick ceilings that Jajamaru-kun can break by jumping into them. Once a passage is made Jajamaru-kun can move through them as can enemies. To clear a level all enemies must be defeated, most enemies can be killed by having a shuriken thrown at them, the only weapon available without a power-up, some need to be stunned either by falling through a hole in a tier or by being jumped on. Enemy projectiles can also be canceled out by the shuriken. Being touched by an enemy projectile, or in a few cases an enemies body, will instantly kill Jajamaru-kun. After an enemy has been killed its spirit will ascend, you can grab this for extra points.\n\nIn each stage at the 80 seconds remaining mark Princess Sakura will, fittingly, drop a cherry blossom onto the field. This will float through the platforms and eventually slip off the bottom of the screen, unless the ninja intercepts this message from his love. Once three blossoms have been collected a bonus stage will occur. In the bonus stage the foe is the Pirate Lord on the top throwing fire down onto Jajamaru-kun below. Here shuriken can be thrown upwards. One hit kills the pirate and frees the princess. As the game progresses these bonus stages become more difficult adding clones of the wicked lord and more fire.\n\nAs the levels progress the new enemies, based on Japanese folklore, emerge. A new enemy will always appear as a &quot;boss&quot;. This new enemy will be the only one of its kind on the top tier and all the other spirits will be comprised of the previous boss. The boss will be more intelligent than the other minions. After a spirit has been the boss for several stages it will become the standard minion and loss some of its difficulty. A new more difficult boss will then appear for the next few levels, and so on.\n\nItems can be found occasionally by breaking a brick ceiling, the items in any give stage are randomized.  Items once uncovered will remain until another ceiling is broken or are picked up. Items that alter the status of ninja have a transient effect.\n\nThe items in this game are:\n\n1. Speed-up: This red ball will increase the determined ninja's speed, now he can get behind even the most cunning kami.\n\n2. Ninja-cart: This little carriage can crush anything in it's path and move at incredible speeds, find this and your victory will be assured!\n\n3. Shuriken: Finding this shuriken will increase the distance your deadly ninja stars can be thrown, snipe those oni.\n\n4. Invisibility Potion: A highly potent blend capable of turning this ninja, if not totally invisible, into an invincible outline.\n\n5. Inscribed Coins: These coins give additional points, different colors give different point valuations.\n2. Extra Ninja: These little ninjas are extra lives, very rare!\n\n6. Bombs: These two bombs can appear when a ceiling is cracked open. If the player is careless enough to jump into them after they are revealed he will surely meet his death. Enemies may pass through bombs with impunity.\n\n7. Trusty Frog: The trusty frog is Jajamaru-kun's trusty steed, by getting three different items, or by gaining four lives, the frog will appear."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Ninja JaJaMaru-kun (&quot;petit ninja à la volonté de fer&quot; en japonais) est un jeu d'action où vous incarnez JaJaMaru, un ninja dont la mission est de libérer la princesse Sakura des griffes du diabolique Lord Namazu. Pour cela, utilisez de redoutables shuriken et éliminez tous les monstres qui croisent votre chemin.\r\n\r\nProfitez également des objets spéciaux (tels que la grenouille géante que vous pouvez chevaucher) pour parvenir au bout de votre quête et traversez de nombreux stages truffés de monstres et de fantômes typiquement Japonais."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Ninja JaJaMaru-kun (übersetzt „kleiner Ninja mit eisernem Willen“) ist ein Actionspiel, in dem Sie als JaJaMaru spielen, ein Ninja, dessen Mission es ist, Prinzessin Sakura aus den Fängen des bösen Lord Namazu zu befreien. Benutzen Sie dazu beeindruckende Shuriken und eliminieren Sie alle Monster, die Ihnen in den Weg kommen.\r\nNutzen Sie auch spezielle Objekte (wie den riesigen Frosch, auf dem Sie reiten können), um das Ende Ihrer Quest zu erreichen und zahlreiche Level voller typisch japanischer Monster und Geister zu durchqueren."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "En un reino del folklore japonés feudal, el homónimo Ninja Jajamaru-kun debe rescatar a su amada Princesa Sakura de las garras de un pirata diabólico con cara de pez gato. Jajamaru-kun comienza en la parte inferior de un campo horizontal de tres niveles. En cada nivel de este campo hay dos enemigos en cada nivel. Los niveles tienen techos de ladrillos débiles que Jajamaru-kun puede romper saltando dentro de ellos. Una vez que se hace un pasaje, Jajamaru-kun puede moverse a través de ellos al igual que los enemigos. Para superar un nivel, todos los enemigos deben ser derrotados, la mayoría de los enemigos pueden ser matados con un shuriken arrojado contra ellos, la única arma disponible sin un encendido, algunos necesitan ser aturdidos ya sea cayendo a través de un agujero en un nivel o al ser saltó sobre Los proyectiles enemigos también pueden ser cancelados por los shuriken. Al ser tocado por un proyectil enemigo, o en algunos casos un cuerpo enemigo, instantáneamente matará a Jajamaru-kun. Después de que un enemigo haya muerto, su espíritu ascenderá, puedes agarrarlo para obtener puntos extra."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Ninja JaJaMaru-kun (&quot;piccolo ninja dalla volontà di ferro&quot; in giapponese) è un gioco d'azione in cui interpreti JaJaMaru, un ninja la cui missione è liberare la principessa Sakura dalle grinfie del malvagio Lord Namazu. Per fare questo, usa formidabili shuriken ed elimina tutti i mostri che incrociano il tuo cammino.\r\nnnApprofitta anche di oggetti speciali (come la rana gigante che puoi cavalcare) per raggiungere la fine della tua ricerca e attraversare molti livelli pieni di mostri e fantasmi tipici giapponesi."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Ninja JaJaMaru-kun (&quot;pequeno ninja com vontade de ferro&quot; em japonês) é um jogo de ação onde você joga como JaJaMaru, um ninja cuja missão é libertar a Princesa Sakura das garras do malvado Senhor Namazu. Para fazer isso, use shuriken formidável e elimine todos os monstros que cruzam seu caminho.\r\n\r\nAproveite também os itens especiais (como o sapo gigante que você pode montar) para completar sua missão e passar por vários estágios cheios de monstros e fantasmas japoneses típicos."
    }
  ],
